      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 516,
        "content": "## 4️⃣ If Emergency\nThe on-call technician gets pinged immediately with the details, and the customer gets confirmation that help is coming, both happen in parallel, not one waiting on the other."
